use binding
register web-1.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use binding-app

grant
  grant call web-1.0 to web

as web call web-1.0

as web assert Anonymous call web-1.0 4 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Denied where a.role == "web" select a.origin
